    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:iscinematicvideocaptureenabled:0002:0001",
      "source": "A BOOL value specifying whether the Cinematic Video effect is being applied to any movie file output, video data output, metadata output, or video preview layer added to the capture session.",
      "ko": "캡처 세션에 추가된 movie file output, video data output, metadata output, 또는 video preview layer 중 하나에 Cinematic Video 효과가 적용되는지 지정하는 `BOOL` 값입니다.",
